30,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"We are wasting money on duplicate supplies, and the management office has a set rate for cleaners.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,A full pass takes over an hour and a half. An outside firm requires us to tidy up first anyway.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It's clear the burden isn't shared. Some of us are barely here, while others do all the cooking.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"The bathroom is a lost cause due to ventilation, and our standards for ""clean"" are completely different.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Our arguments always start with reminders. Also, the previous tenants tried permanent assignments and it ruined their friendship.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, if the firm requires tidying, does that actually save us time?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Not entirely, but it removes the deep scrubbing. Still, the time spent is significant.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, if permanent assignments cause friction, we should avoid that.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"@Toshio, if we have different standards, a professional service might be the only way to be consistent.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. We need a system that doesn't lead to resentment or nagging.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A professional service would cost a fair bit, but it would solve the ""standard"" issue May mentioned.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm worried about the time. A rota still leaves us with those heavy cleaning blocks.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A rota is unfair if some people are away for a month while others are here daily.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,I can't stand the guessing game. I'd rather pay to know it's actually clean.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Midori,,Let's consider the options carefully. We need harmony more than we need to save a few yen.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll support whatever ensures the bills are settled clearly and fairly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"If we can offload the hours, I'm in.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'll vote for the most logical distribution of effort.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,May,,I'm leaning towards the professional service.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Midori,,I just want us to stay friends.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
